<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Benifit.net - Foydali Kontent Platformasi</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Lucide Icons CDN -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <!-- Tailwind Configuration for Custom Neon Colors -->
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brandDark: '#090D16',
                        brandCard: '#111827',
                        cyanNeon: '#00E5FF',
                        cyanAccent: '#38BDF8',
                        crimsonRed: '#EF4444',
                        crimsonNeon: '#FF2E93'
                    },
                    boxShadow: {
                        'neon-cyan': '0 0 15px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.35)',
                        'neon-red': '0 0 15px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4)',
                        'glow-card': '0 4px 20px -2px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.15)'
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <!-- Custom CSS Styles and Animations -->
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #090D16;
            color: #F3F4F6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Glassmorphism Effect */
        .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        .red-line-top {
            border-top: 2px solid #EF4444;
        }

        .red-line-bottom {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #EF4444;
        }

        /* Hide scrollbar for Chrome, Safari and Opera */
        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }
        /* Hide scrollbar for IE, Edge and Firefox */
        .no-scrollbar {
            -ms-overflow-style: none;  /* IE and Edge */
            scrollbar-width: none;  /* Firefox */
        }

        /* Video Progress Bar Animation */
        .video-progress {
            transition: width 0.1s linear;
        }

        /* Pulse glow animation */
        @keyframes cyanGlow {
            0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,229,255,0.4); }
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0,229,255,0.8); }
        }
        .pulse-cyan {
            animation: cyanGlow 3s infinite;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-brandDark text-gray-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col">

    <!-- Header / Navbar -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 w-full glass-panel border-b border-gray-800/80 px-4 py-3">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            
            <!-- Logo with Cyan & Red Accent Line -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer" onclick="switchTab('home')">
                <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-gray-900 to-black border border-cyanNeon/40 shadow-neon-cyan">
                    <i data-lucide="zap" class="w-6 h-6 text-cyanNeon"></i>
                    <span class="absolute -bottom-1 w-full h-[2px] bg-crimsonRed rounded-full"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col">
                    <span class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-wider bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-cyanNeon via-cyanAccent to-white drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(0,229,255,0.5)]">
                        BENIFIT<span class="text-crimsonRed text-2xl">.net</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="text-[9px] text-gray-400 tracking-widest uppercase -mt-1 font-semibold">Foydali Kontent Platformasi</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Search Bar with Category Quick Search -->
            <div class="hidden md:flex flex-1 max-w-md relative">
                <i data-lucide="search" class="absolute left-3 top-2.5 w-4 h-4 text-gray-400"></i>
                <input type="text" id="searchInput" onkeyup="handleSearch()" placeholder="Foydali kurslar, texnologiya yoki psixologiya qidiring..." 
                    class="w-full bg-gray-900/80 text-sm text-gray-200 placeholder-gray-500 rounded-full pl-9 pr-4 py-2 border border-gray-800 focus:border-cyanNeon focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyanNeon transition-all">
            </div>

            <!-- Header Action Buttons -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <button onclick="openUploadModal()" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyanNeon to-cyanAccent hover:from-cyanAccent hover:to-cyanNeon text-gray-950 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl transition-all transform hover:scale-105 shadow-neon-cyan">
                    <i data-lucide="plus-circle" class="w-4 h-4 stroke-[2.5]"></i>
                    <span class="hidden sm:inline">Video Yuklash</span>
                </button>

                <button onclick="switchTab('analytics')" class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 hover:border-crimsonRed text-gray-300 hover:text-crimsonRed transition-all relative" title="Foydali Vaqt Dashboard">
                    <i data-lucide="activity" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                    <span class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-crimsonRed rounded-full animate-ping"></span>
                    <span class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-crimsonRed rounded-full"></span>
                </button>

                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl border border-cyanNeon/50 p-0.5 overflow-hidden cursor-pointer" onclick="switchTab('profile')">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=100&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="Profile" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Layout Grid -->
    <div class="flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto flex gap-6 px-2 sm:px-4 py-4">
        
        <!-- Left Sidebar Navigation (Desktop) -->
        <aside class="hidden lg:flex flex-col w-64 shrink-0 gap-2 sticky top-20 h-[calc(100vh-6rem)]">
            <div class="glass-panel p-4 rounded-2xl flex flex-col gap-1 border-t-2 border-t-crimsonRed">
                <button onclick="switchTab('home')" id="nav-home" class="nav-btn active flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold transition-all text-cyanNeon bg-cyanNeon/10 border border-cyanNeon/30">
                    <i data-lucide="home" class="w-5 h-5"></i> Assosiy Lenta
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('reels')" id="nav-reels" class="nav-btn flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-gray-800/60 transition-all">
                    <i data-lucide="clapperboard" class="w-5 h-5 text-crimsonRed"></i> Reels (Fokus Rejim)
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('bookmarks')" id="nav-bookmarks" class="nav-btn flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-gray-800/60 transition-all">
                    <i data-lucide="bookmark" class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-400"></i> Saqlanganlar
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('analytics')" id="nav-analytics" class="nav-btn flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-gray-800/60 transition-all">
                    <i data-lucide="trending-up" class="w-5 h-5 text-green-400"></i> Vaqt Samaradorligi
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('profile')" id="nav-profile" class="nav-btn flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-gray-800/60 transition-all">
                    <i data-lucide="user" class="w-5 h-5 text-cyanAccent"></i> Profilim
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Anti-Brainrot Guarantee Banner -->
            <div class="glass-panel p-4 rounded-2xl border border-cyanNeon/20 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-900 to-gray-950 relative overflow-hidden mt-auto">
                <div class="absolute -right-6 -bottom-6 w-24 h-24 bg-cyanNeon/10 rounded-full blur-xl"></div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-cyanNeon uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
                    <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyanNeon"></i> Brainrot-Siz Hudud
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                    Benifit.net algoritmlari behuda va vaqt o'g'irlovchi videolarni bloklaydi. Faqat ilm va rivojlanish!
                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-gray-800 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-gray-400">
                    <span>Bugun tejalgan vaqt:</span>
                    <span class="font-bold text-crimsonNeon">+42 daqiqa</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- Center Content Area -->
        <main class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-4">
            
            <!-- Category Pills Filter Scrollable Bar -->
            <div class="glass-panel p-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar" id="categoryBar">
                <!-- Javascript will populate categories -->
            </div>

            <!-- View Mode Switcher Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span id="currentCategoryTitle" class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="sparkles" class="w-5 h-5 text-cyanNeon"></i> Barcha Foydali Videolar
                    </span>
                    <span id="videoCountBadge" class="bg-gray-800 text-cyanAccent text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-gray-700">6 video</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Feed vs Reels Toggle Button -->
                <div class="bg-gray-900 p-1 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 flex items-center gap-1">
                    <button onclick="setFeedLayout('grid')" id="btn-layout-grid" class="p-1.5 rounded-lg text-cyanNeon bg-gray-800 transition-all" title="Lenta Korinishi">
                        <i data-lucide="layout-grid" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="setFeedLayout('feed')" id="btn-layout-feed" class="p-1.5 rounded-lg text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-all" title="Instagram Post Korinishi">
                        <i data-lucide="square-stack" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Dynamic View Containers -->
            
            <!-- 1. HOME FEED VIEW -->
            <div id="view-home" class="view-panel transition-all">
                <div id="videosContainer" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
                    <!-- Dynamic Video Cards will be injected here -->
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. REELS / FOCUS REJIM VIEW -->
            <div id="view-reels" class="view-panel hidden flex flex-col items-center">
                <div class="w-full max-w-sm h-[75vh] glass-panel rounded-3xl overflow-hidden relative border border-gray-800 flex flex-col justify-end shadow-2xl" id="reelsContainer">
                    <!-- Active Reels video player inserted dynamically -->
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-4">
                    <button onclick="prevReel()" class="p-3 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 hover:border-cyanNeon rounded-full text-white transition-all">
                        <i data-lucide="arrow-up" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                    </button>
                    <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400" id="reelsCounter">1 / 5</span>
                    <button onclick="nextReel()" class="p-3 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 hover:border-cyanNeon rounded-full text-white transition-all">
                        <i data-lucide="arrow-down" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. BOOKMARKS VIEW -->
            <div id="view-bookmarks" class="view-panel hidden">
                <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 mb-4">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="bookmark" class="text-yellow-400"></i> Saqlangan Foydali Bilimlar
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Keyinroq ko'rish va o'rganish uchun belgilangan darslik va ideyalar.</p>
                </div>
                <div id="bookmarksContainer" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
                    <!-- Bookmarked cards dynamically injected -->
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 4. ANALYTICS / IMPACT DASHBOARD VIEW -->
            <div id="view-analytics" class="view-panel hidden">
                <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-3xl border border-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden mb-6">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-cyanNeon/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
                    
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4 border-b border-gray-800 pb-6 mb-6">
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-crimsonNeon uppercase tracking-widest">Shaxsiy Rivojlanish Statistika</span>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mt-1">Foydali Vaqt Impact Dashboard</h2>
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Instagram / TikTok domingiz o'rniga orttirilgan amaliy bilim vaqt va samaradorligi.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="px-4 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyanNeon/20 to-transparent border border-cyanNeon/40 rounded-xl text-cyanNeon text-sm font-bold">
                            Level 4: Bilim Izlovchi 🚀
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
                        <div class="bg-gray-900/80 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-800">
                            <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1">
                                <i data-lucide="clock" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyanNeon"></i> Korilgan Foydali Vaqt
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-white">3 soat 45 min</div>
                            <div class="text-[11px] text-green-400 mt-1">↑ 24% o'tgan haftadan ko'p</div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-gray-900/80 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-800">
                            <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1">
                                <i data-lucide="shield-alert" class="w-4 h-4 text-crimsonRed"></i> Tejalgan Bekorchi Vaqt
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-crimsonNeon">12 soat 20 min</div>
                            <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 mt-1">Doomscrolling oldi olindi</div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-gray-900/80 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-800">
                            <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1">
                                <i data-lucide="award" class="w-4 h-4 text-yellow-400"></i> O'rganilgan Ko'nikmalar
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-cyanAccent">18 ta Resurs</div>
                            <div class="text-[11px] text-cyanNeon mt-1">3 ta topshiriq bajarildi</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Category Breakdown Progress Bars -->
                    <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-200 mb-3">Sohalar bo'yicha sarflangan unumli vaqt:</h3>
                    <div class="space-y-3">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs mb-1">
                                <span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Ta'lim & Dasturlash</span>
                                <span class="text-cyanNeon font-bold">45% (1s 40m)</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-full h-2 bg-gray-900 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                                <div class="h-full bg-cyanNeon rounded-full" style="width: 45%"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs mb-1">
                                <span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Biznes & Moliya</span>
                                <span class="text-cyanAccent font-bold">30% (1s 05m)</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-full h-2 bg-gray-900 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                                <div class="h-full bg-cyanAccent rounded-full" style="width: 30%"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs mb-1">
                                <span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Chet Tillari & IELTS</span>
                                <span class="text-crimsonNeon font-bold">25% (55m)</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-full h-2 bg-gray-900 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                                <div class="h-full bg-crimsonNeon rounded-full" style="width: 25%"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 5. USER PROFILE VIEW -->
            <div id="view-profile" class="view-panel hidden">
                <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-3xl border border-gray-800 mb-6">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-6">
                        <div class="relative">
                            <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl p-1 bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyanNeon via-crimsonRed to-cyanAccent shadow-neon-cyan">
                                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=300&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl">
                            </div>
                            <span class="absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 bg-cyanNeon text-gray-950 p-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold" title="Tasdiqlangan Ekspert">
                                <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="text-center sm:text-left flex-1">
                            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                                <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">Malika Rahimova</h2>
                                <span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyanNeon/10 text-cyanNeon border border-cyanNeon/30 w-fit mx-auto sm:mx-0">
                                    EdTech Creator
                                </span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-3">@malika_dev • Frontend Dasturchi & IT Mentori 💻 | Foydali kontent ulashuvchisi</p>
                            
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-6 text-sm">
                                <div><strong class="text-white font-bold">14</strong> <span class="text-gray-400 text-xs">Video</span></div>
                                <div><strong class="text-white font-bold">12.8k</strong> <span class="text-gray-400 text-xs">Kuzatuvchi</span></div>
                                <div><strong class="text-white font-bold">99.4%</strong> <span class="text-gray-400 text-xs">Foydalilik Reytinqi</span></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="video" class="w-5 h-5 text-cyanNeon"></i> Yuklangan Videolarim
                </h3>
                <div id="profileVideosGrid" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <!-- User videos dynamically placed here -->
                </div>
            </div>

        </main>
    </div>

    <!-- UPLOAD VIDEO MODAL -->
    <div id="uploadModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div class="glass-panel max-w-lg w-full rounded-3xl border border-gray-800 p-6 relative shadow-2xl red-line-top">
            <button onclick="closeUploadModal()" class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-gray-400 hover:text-white p-1 rounded-lg bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800">
                <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
            </button>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-cyanNeon/10 text-cyanNeon border border-cyanNeon/30">
                    <i data-lucide="upload-cloud" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Foydali Video Yuklash</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Jamiyatga foyda keltiradigan kontent ulashing</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <form id="uploadForm" onsubmit="handleUploadSubmit(event)" class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1">Video Sarlavhasi</label>
                    <input type="text" id="upTitle" required placeholder="Masalan: Dasturlashda 5 ta eng ko'p qilinadigan xato..." 
                        class="w-full bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 focus:border-cyanNeon text-sm rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-white focus:outline-none">
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1">Turkum (Bo'lim)</label>
                        <select id="upCategory" class="w-full bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 focus:border-cyanNeon text-sm rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-white focus:outline-none">
                            <option value="Ta'lim (Edu)">Ta'lim (Edu)</option>
                            <option value="Ish va Martaba">Ish va Martaba</option>
                            <option value="Texnologiya">Texnologiya</option>
                            <option value="Biznes & Moliya">Biznes & Moliya</option>
                            <option value="Shaxsiy Rivojlanish">Shaxsiy Rivojlanish</option>
                            <option value="Reklama & Hamkorlik">Reklama & Hamkorlik</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1">Namuna Video Tanlash</label>
                        <select id="upVideoUrl" class="w-full bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 focus:border-cyanNeon text-sm rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-white focus:outline-none">
                            <option value="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/preview/mixkit-software-developer-working-on-code-41002-large.mp4">IT & Dasturlash Code MP4</option>
                            <option value="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/preview/mixkit-hands-holding-a-smartphone-with-green-screen-41221-large.mp4">Mobile Tech & Apps MP4</option>
                            <option value="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/preview/mixkit-hands-typing-on-a-laptop-keyboard-41198-large.mp4">Ofis & Biznes Ish MP4</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1">Qisqa Mazmuni va Xulosasi (Takeaways)</label>
                    <textarea id="upDescription" rows="3" required placeholder="Videodan olinadigan 3 ta asosiy foydali xulosa..." 
                        class="w-full bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 focus:border-cyanNeon text-sm rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-white focus:outline-none resize-none"></textarea>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1">Hashtaglar</label>
                    <input type="text" id="upTags" placeholder="#talim #talabalar #frontend" 
                        class="w-full bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 focus:border-cyanNeon text-sm rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2 text-white focus:outline-none">
                </div>

                <div class="p-3 bg-gray-900/60 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 text-[11px] text-gray-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="info" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyanNeon shrink-0"></i>
                    <span>Eslatma: Benifit.net sifat va foydalilik nazoratidan so'ng videoni e'lon qiladi.</span>
